    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d7-a2">

                <pb facs="0135" n="125" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv08/pg125"/>

                <head>Appendix B to HD–48</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation<anchor n="5" xml:id="d7-f1"
                    />]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Draft of an Article To Be Inserted in
                        the Treaty With Bulgaria</hi></p>
                <p>The Principal Allied and Associated Powers reserve the right to examine the title
                    to possession of the Dobrudja, and to invite Rou-mania to cede to Bulgaria any
                    part of the Dobrudja where the Roumanians are in the minority and the Bulgars in
                    the majority, under conditions which the Allied and Associated Powers shall
                    consider just and equitable.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
